---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import CavurneGallery from "../components/CavurneGallery.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import imgCavurne from "../assets/cavurnes/cavurne-noir-paysage.jpg";
---

<Layout
  title="Cavurnes & Monuments cinéraires | Marbrerie du Hainaut"
  description="Conception et installation de cavurnes et monuments cinéraires. Des espaces de recueillement intimes et personnalisés."
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="pt-20">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative bg-base-darker pt-32 pb-24 overflow-hidden shadow-inner">
      <div class="absolute inset-0">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-br from-base-darker via-surface to-base-dark"></div>
        <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-[0.06]" viewBox="0 0 1200 400" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path d="M0,200 Q300,150 600,220 T1200,180" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" fill="none" />
          <path d="M0,100 Q400,80 700,150 T1200,100" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none" />
          <path d="M0,300 Q350,280 650,330 T1200,290" stroke="white" stroke-width="1" fill="none" />
        </svg>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-linear-to-b from-base-darker/60 via-transparent to-base-darker/80"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center reveal">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <span class="block h-px w-12 bg-linear-to-r from-transparent to-gold/50"></span>
          <span class="text-gold text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-body">Monuments cinéraires</span>
          <span class="block h-px w-12 bg-linear-to-l from-transparent to-gold/50"></span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold text-text drop-shadow-md">
          Conception de <span class="text-accent-light">Cavurnes</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Un lieu de recueillement intime et durable, spécialement conçu pour la préservation des urnes funéraires.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Intro Section -->
    <section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 bg-light-alt overflow-hidden">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
          <div class="reveal">
            <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-4 block">Définition</span>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-dark-text mb-6 leading-tight">
              Qu'est-ce qu'un <span class="text-accent">cavurne</span> ?
            </h2>

            <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
              <p class="text-dark-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                Nous vous proposons de prendre en charge la conception de votre cavurne. Pour rappel, le cavurne est un <span class="text-dark-text font-semibold">caveau de petite taille</span> dans lequel peuvent être disposées des urnes contenant les cendres du défunt. Le but dans ce cas sera de vous permettre de vous recueillir.
              </p>
              <p class="text-dark-text-muted leading-relaxed">
                Le cavurne est un concept qui s'inspire du caveau lui-même. Ils partagent les mêmes objectifs : permettre aux proches de se recueillir après la mort du défunt. C'est un monument cinéraire à part entière.
              </p>
              <p class="text-dark-text-muted leading-relaxed italic border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 mt-6">
                Chez nous, on mise essentiellement sur notre savoir-faire et notre expérience pour vous garantir un résultat de qualité et surtout, un résultat original, en fonction de vos besoins et de vos moyens.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.2s">
            <div class="relative rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-accent/10">
              <div class="w-full h-[400px] sm:h-[480px] bg-base-dark relative">
                <Image src={imgCavurne} alt="Photo d'un cavurne" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
              </div>
              <div class="absolute -bottom-3 -right-3 w-28 h-28 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-gold/30 rounded-br-xl"></div>
              <div class="absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-28 h-28 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-accent/30 rounded-tl-xl"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Details Section -->
    <section class="relative py-24 sm:py-32 bg-light overflow-hidden">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="text-center mb-16 reveal">
          <span class="text-accent text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-4 block">Spécificités</span>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-dark-text">
            À chaque défunt <span class="text-accent">son cavurne</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 relative">
          <!-- Step 1 -->
          <div class="reveal relative group" style="transition-delay: 0.1s">
            <div class="h-full bg-light-surface border border-border-light rounded-xl p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent/5 hover:-translate-y-1">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent mb-6">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" /></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-dark-text mb-3">L'installation</h3>
              <p class="text-dark-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Le cavurne est installé trois jours à l'avance, avant ou après les obsèques. Il est destiné à la protection de l'urne et est conçu suivant les exigences du terrain où sera placée l'urne funéraire.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Step 2 -->
          <div class="reveal relative group" style="transition-delay: 0.2s">
            <div class="h-full bg-light-surface border border-border-light rounded-xl p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent/5 hover:-translate-y-1">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent mb-6">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.53 16.122a3 3 0 00-5.78 1.128 2.25 2.25 0 01-2.4 2.245 4.5 4.5 0 008.4-2.245c0-.399-.078-.78-.22-1.128zm0 0a15.998 15.998 0 003.388-1.62m-5.043-.025a15.994 15.994 0 011.622-3.395m3.42 3.42a15.995 15.995 0 004.764-4.648l3.876-5.814a1.151 1.151 0 00-1.597-1.597L14.146 6.32a15.996 15.996 0 00-4.649 4.763m3.42 3.42a6.776 6.776 0 00-3.42-3.42" /></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-dark-text mb-3">La personnalisation</h3>
              <p class="text-dark-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                La prestation est personnalisée. Après l'incinération, les proches passent commande du cavurne. Il est conçu à la demande, le plus souvent visualisé à l'image de la personnalité du défunt.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <div class="reveal relative group" style="transition-delay: 0.3s">
            <div class="h-full bg-light-surface border border-border-light rounded-xl p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent/5 hover:-translate-y-1">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center text-accent mb-6">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.375 19.5h17.25m-17.25 0a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125M3.375 19.5h1.5C5.496 19.5 6 18.996 6 18.375m-3.75 0V5.625m0 12.75v-1.5c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125m18.375 2.625V5.625m0 12.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125m1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125m0 3.75h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0118 18.375M20.625 4.5H3.375m17.25 0c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125M20.625 4.5h-1.5C18.504 4.5 18 5.004 18 5.625m3.75 0v1.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125M3.375 4.5c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125M3.375 4.5h1.5C5.496 4.5 6 5.004 6 5.625m-3.75 0v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125m1.5-3.75C5.496 8.25 6 7.746 6 7.125v-1.5M4.875 8.25C5.496 8.25 6 8.754 6 9.375v1.5m0-5.25v5.25m0-5.25C6 5.004 6.504 4.5 7.125 4.5h9.75c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125m1.125 2.625h1.5m-1.5 0A1.125 1.125 0 0118 7.125v-1.5m1.125 2.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v1.5m2.625-2.625c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v1.5c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125M18 5.625v5.25m0-5.25C18 5.004 17.496 4.5 16.875 4.5H7.125M18 10.875v5.25m0-5.25c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H7.125m10.875 6.375v5.25m0-5.25c0-.621-.504-1.125-1.125-1.125H7.125m0 11.625v-5.25m0 5.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h9.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125m-12-5.25v5.25m0-5.25C6 16.125 6.504 15.625 7.125 15.625h9.75c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125m-12 5.25c-.621 0-1.125-.504-1.125-1.125v-1.5c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125M6 18.375v1.5m-1.125-2.625h-1.5M18 18.375v1.5m1.125-2.625h1.5" /></svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-semibold text-dark-text mb-3">Qualité des matériaux</h3>
              <p class="text-dark-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Le cavurne que nous vous proposons est fait de granit, c'est un matériau d'excellente qualité, extrêmement résistant face aux intempéries et appelé à durer dans le temps.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Gallery Section -->
    <CavurneGallery />

    <!-- CTA Section -->
    <section class="relative py-20 sm:py-28 bg-base-darker overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0">
        <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-[0.04]" viewBox="0 0 1200 600" preserveAspectRatio="none">
          <path d="M0,300 Q300,250 600,320 T1200,280" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" fill="none" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center reveal">
        <span class="text-gold text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-4 block">Une question ?</span>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-text mb-6">
          Nous sommes à votre <span class="text-accent-light">écoute</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10">
          Nos artisans marbriers sont disponibles pour vous conseiller dans le choix et la conception de votre cavurne. Devis gratuit et personnalisé.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full max-w-md mx-auto sm:max-w-none">
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-accent px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-accent-light hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-accent/25 hover:-translate-y-0.5 w-full sm:w-auto"
          >
            Demander un devis
          </a>
          <a
            href="tel:0362020950"
            class="inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border border-text/30 px-8 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-text uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-text/10 hover:border-text/60 hover:-translate-y-0.5 w-full sm:w-auto"
          >
            03 62 02 09 50
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
